        "  * Parametrisation of the shape\n",
        "  * $\\Omega = \\Omega\\left(\\textcolor{LGreenLMS}{\\para}\\right)$\n",
        "    * SVD\n",
        "    * k-PCA\n",
        "    * Auto-encoder\n",
